description:
Design a 104x16 asynchronous FIFO (First-In-First-Out) buffer. The module receives a reset signal, two clock inputs for write and read operations, and 104 bits of data. It includes write and read enable signals for controlling data flow. The outputs indicate the status of the FIFO, but currently, they are hardwired to always indicate the FIFO is empty, not full, and no data is outputted, effectively making it a placeholder skeleton for a FIFO design.
